    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/e2a2c0f8802320e4f6e96165e2066740.poster.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/e2a2c0f8802320e4f6e96165e2066740.webm?t=1748359218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/e2a2c0f8802320e4f6e96165e2066740.mp4?t=1748359218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/e07476397a402f882fd01949fc39efa1.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=94 /></span><br><br>Step into the shoes of Detective Clay Kriest in &quot;Baisu&quot; a chilling tale of family, art, and the haunting unknown. As you arrive at the secluded residence, responding to an eerie call for help, you'll find yourself immersed in a quest shrouded in darkness.<br><br>This eerie house was once a sanctuary for the Smith family, led by the renowned artist Jolie Smith. But the serenity of nature has given way to a creeping darkness that clings to the walls.<br><br>Discover the secrets concealed within Jolie's paintings, piece together the family's story, and confront the malevolent force that lingers within the place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/a5ed27fbac07bc1869455985d9706921.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=94 /></span><br><br>With a loyal dog by your side, explore sinister surroundings, and survive the lurking horrors. Can you solve the mystery and unravel all has happened?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/52d3cf781e9f19be99768abf13b9932d.poster.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/52d3cf781e9f19be99768abf13b9932d.webm?t=1748359218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/52d3cf781e9f19be99768abf13b9932d.mp4?t=1748359218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;Baisu&quot; is a psychological, photorealistic bodycam adventure that will test your wits and nerves. It will take all that you got, to stay sane.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/a99bf13d2fd69e21f1c40d57f7da6b5d.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=94 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/5f9020ff5acbb5dc00ce7d5b23dc01b4.poster.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/5f9020ff5acbb5dc00ce7d5b23dc01b4.webm?t=1748359218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/5f9020ff5acbb5dc00ce7d5b23dc01b4.mp4?t=1748359218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key Features:<br><br>- A gripping psychological horror narrative<br>- Immersive forest house environment filled with chilling mysteries<br>- Loyal canine companion, Bella, to aid your journey<br>- Body cam experience<br>- Realistic flashlight movement<br>- Multiple endings<br><br><br><br>Dive into the unknown and confront your fears in &quot;Baisu&quot; where every step you take uncovers another layer of the haunting mystery.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/e2a2c0f8802320e4f6e96165e2066740.poster.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/e2a2c0f8802320e4f6e96165e2066740.webm?t=1748359218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/e2a2c0f8802320e4f6e96165e2066740.mp4?t=1748359218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/e07476397a402f882fd01949fc39efa1.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=94 /></span><br><br>Step into the shoes of Detective Clay Kriest in &quot;Baisu&quot; a chilling tale of family, art, and the haunting unknown. As you arrive at the secluded residence, responding to an eerie call for help, you'll find yourself immersed in a quest shrouded in darkness.<br><br>This eerie house was once a sanctuary for the Smith family, led by the renowned artist Jolie Smith. But the serenity of nature has given way to a creeping darkness that clings to the walls.<br><br>Discover the secrets concealed within Jolie's paintings, piece together the family's story, and confront the malevolent force that lingers within the place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821850/extras/a5ed27fbac07bc1869455985d9706921.avif?t=1748359218\" width=600 height=94 /></span><br><br>With a loyal dog by your side, explore sinister surroundings, and survive the lurking horrors. Can you solve the mystery and unravel all has happened?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar